@ECHO OFF
ECHO AT28C64B SDP WRITE TEST - WILLEM 0.0.4
ECHO INSERT THE EEPROM IN ITS NORMAL BOTTOM-ALIGNED POSITION.
ECHO SET DIP SWITCHES ON: 1 2 4 6 9. ALL OTHERS OFF.
ECHO THIS WILL OVERWRITE THE EEPROM WITH T01ALIVE.BIN.
ECHO DO NOT ADD /TRACE: SDP COMMAND TIMING IS STRICT.
PAUSE
WILLEM W28C64 T01ALIVE.BIN 378 /WRITE
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
WILLEM R28C64 T01READ.BIN 378
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
FC /B T01ALIVE.BIN T01READ.BIN
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
ECHO SDP WRITE, READBACK, AND BINARY COMPARE PASSED.
GOTO END
:FAIL
ECHO FAILED - COPY WILLEM.LOG BACK. DO NOT USE THIS CHIP YET.
:END
